I like the idea. And I love that you played with our mind "Wait! that''s four, not two!" But I wish you would have had the focus on the cut inside of the watermelon reflection, not on the backs of the watermelon. That''s where you''ve led my eye, but it''s uncomfortable having that part out of focus.</td>', 'I like the idea. And I love that you played with our mind "Wait! that''s four, not two!" But I wish you would have had the focus on the cut inside of the watermelon reflection, not on the backs of the watermelon. That''s where you''ve led my eye, but it''s uncomfortable having that part out of focus.', '2025-09-15 08:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7794394, 1299532, 103142, '<td valign="top">
